# Memory Loop TUI Dashboard Implementation Plan

> **For agentic workers:** REQUIRED SUB-SKILL: Use superpowers:subagent-driven-development (recommended) or superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan task-by-task. Steps use checkbox (`- [ ]`) syntax for tracking.

**Goal:** Build a full-screen interactive bubbletea TUI for browsing, managing, and testing memory loop records via `entire memory-loop tui`.

**Architecture:** New `memorylooptui` package with composite bubbletea model — root model delegates to 4 tab sub-models (memories, injection, history, settings). Unidirectional state flow: sub-models emit messages, root model mutates and saves via existing `memoryloop` package functions.

**Tech Stack:** Go 1.26, charmbracelet/bubbletea v1.3.6, charmbracelet/bubbles v0.21.1, charmbracelet/lipgloss v1.1.0, existing memoryloop package for all data operations.

**Spec:** `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-03-26-memory-loop-tui-design.md`

